{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0cc22999768ecbfd8096dc73e7e316f6c60de8631a3ec21ee0dbb0ecbe600249","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"husu/loom@905416f838bf snapshot a6063738faa5e442","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e84f117877105598c004ae0b8460a9071a146b37029423b88bf4a5017958d69","slc_24a969b8bedc98a65f099718ec00a58d32d7c0f21fdd04eb0992974a69fea5f4","slc_26f0be3f2bba1f60226cab12d50265807eccc28deb6888db1c0c7759d25b3c8e","slc_9e9d584fa38a0f61634e77b949f035529587be77d2d88670caca5f147c672f1a"],"source_ids":["src_658fc31717905270958174ce96a3334f","src_f2744588dd185e139217bea443f5c02e"],"text":"Loom uses a custom JSON Schema format (draft-07) for API docs, with module title/description, an endpoints array carrying path, HTTP method, optional request schema (headers, params, query, body), and responses keyed by status code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2486e910279353cd73e356bc0171c3705ee659602ef47d8ae019c342d30d13f3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"husu/loom@905416f838bf snapshot a6063738faa5e442","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2943a2d2f6698d8057b778f09e746895e8958b5a9c2aa96cd22055adfcbcf6bb","slc_3f7826deaf343908ada7ab726b881463fc24a25b4160173b27486a4cb8e5a18a","slc_79a0129992e58018fad3201e99e8c4cddf20b834f095da826aa3dadeec789c06","slc_acdaa2436ab072030a47238509b6377a122b8f100f50c92b75b1d312548a8d6f","slc_b95d5dce239b21a8e79d37e77de33f976b28ff10259cd817f8ea603b5693acea","slc_ced663f4fdf5aa09d228868cb24f127b4f524c0ca3cadecd7c8014ffb45c374a"],"source_ids":["src_658fc31717905270958174ce96a3334f","src_f2744588dd185e139217bea443f5c02e"],"text":"Chat input history is persisted globally at ~/.loom/history.jsonl (capped at 100 entries) and is navigable across sessions with arrow keys; configuration lives at ~/.loom/config.json while docs/ stays per-project.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4e50f0c47ca654055650cbfbfb6f58e4f13b932b748d9e67d8a5b48f54567291","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"husu/loom@905416f838bf snapshot a6063738faa5e442","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_709887a300aa6e57333345d3e0b77bac70101e0d63a00c1b28ad8423490b43c1","slc_8e512a756d18d15a31b4ba930df1dd7d9f9dcf6b58efc69d18a5aeb789b6a972"],"source_ids":["src_658fc31717905270958174ce96a3334f"],"text":"The documented project structure includes an agents system with tool calling and conversation memory, an LLM client for DeepSeek/OpenAI, agent tools for schema generation/validation and file operations, an Ink-based TUI, a Fastify web viewer with React SPA frontend, and a mock server with dynamic route registration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ffcba04acd6d33c02fac2bd5540bc52358c2e38e0f882d25de54e7cb66fdb73","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"husu/loom@905416f838bf snapshot a6063738faa5e442","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0da83bcd2dd67cfd7eaab4d39022172bb4091bfe1e89e2cd2b03c2f483fa074d","slc_3f7826deaf343908ada7ab726b881463fc24a25b4160173b27486a4cb8e5a18a","slc_6c488a30c0eea7ba5e2d85ea3728dc5a2d5487df41c6e30f24d860e681d4130b","slc_acdaa2436ab072030a47238509b6377a122b8f100f50c92b75b1d312548a8d6f"],"source_ids":["src_658fc31717905270958174ce96a3334f","src_f2744588dd185e139217bea443f5c02e"],"text":"The /scan feature caches LLM output keyed by file content hash in <outDir>/.loom-scan-cache.json, skipping unchanged files on incremental rescans; cache invalidation is driven by source-hash plus per-entry shape checks rather than a global version wipe.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70706102a347bfa0e4ec04f4243998cfaeb8d7ce272a1c4c9e448e74fe85a1b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"husu/loom@905416f838bf snapshot a6063738faa5e442","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_30e5e82f321a76814a36a64ab4f615fff7ba32d7057951d7417e32aac7fc1b28"],"source_ids":["src_f2744588dd185e139217bea443f5c02e"],"text":"Inside `loom chat`, slash commands include /help, /reset, /list, /mock, /view, /scan <dir> (with resume/reset), /abort, and /exit; Tab autocompletes commands and arrow keys navigate persisted history.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:58:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_888a1204c6d145b282c33470a9556fe2"}
